// A salvager (GDR-0123): the escort template with salvage between fights. It fights what the leader has locked as
// the escort does (backing off when badly hurt); with nothing locked it strips the nearest wreck within 250 m while
// its hold has room ([[behavior_node:salvage]]), and keeps near the leader once there is none or the hold is full.
// 21 Oct 2026 (GDR-0129): it strips only while its leader is within 80 m and no enemy within 300 m, so it keeps up with
// the fleet: over 320 seeds of the voyage runner (rim skiff with two rim skiff escorts) `yard_approach` cleared 229
// against 216 without the two checks (232 with plain escorts), `halvex_drift` 137 against 131 (162); it hauls a little
// less (median 8 against 12 items; 5 with plain escorts).
// Four rules, so it fits a logic core; a tamed automaton core (two rule slots) runs only the fighting ones.
// PLACEHOLDER.
(
    id: "salvager",
    name: "Salvager",
    summary: "Fight whatever your leader has locked; between fights, strip the wrecks near by and stay near the leader when the hold is full.",
    description: "Fights like the [[behavior:escort]]: only the [[behavior_node:locked|leader's lock]], so it never wakes a sleeping pack on its own. Without a lock it [[behavior_node:salvage|flies slowly over the nearest wreck]] [[behavior_node:wreck_in_range|within range]] while its [[behavior_node:cargo_full|hold has room]], its [[behavior_node:leader_near|leader is close]] and [[behavior_node:enemies_near|no enemy is near]], and [[behavior_node:escort|keeps near its leader]] otherwise, so it does not fall behind the fleet. Give it cargo bays.",
    tags: ["escort", "salvage"],
    target: "locked(core)",
    rules: [
        "when hull < 30% and target_on_me -> kite(150%) # badly hurt and under its guns: open the gap",
        "always -> approach(70%) # nose on the leader's target, inside every gun's reach",
        "when wreck_in_range(250m) and not cargo_full and leader_near(80m) and enemies_near(300m) < 1 -> salvage # nothing locked and all quiet: strip a wreck near the leader",
        "always -> escort(30m) # hold full or nothing near: keep near the leader",
    ],
)
